---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Legal Notice & Privacy Policy">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-8 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
      Legal Notice & Privacy Policy
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold border-b pb-2">1. Legal Notice</h2>
        <p>
          All policy information, data and analytical tools provided by CCUS
          Policy Hub (hereinafter "the Platform") are for reference only. We
          work to keep information accurate but do not guarantee its timeliness,
          completeness or accuracy.
        </p>
        <p>
          The Platform contains links to third-party websites, provided for
          convenience only. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy or
          privacy practices of third-party sites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold border-b pb-2">2. Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>We value your privacy. The Platform operates on these principles:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Data collection</strong>: The Platform currently requires no
            user registration. We only collect basic access data (such as page
            views and visiting countries) through anonymous analytics to improve
            the user experience.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Cookie usage</strong>: We only use essential cookies to
            store your preferences (such as dark-mode state and the policy
            comparison list).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Third-party services</strong>: The Platform may use
            third-party services (such as Google Fonts and OpenStreetMap) to
            provide specific features; these services may collect anonymous
            information under their own privacy policies.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold border-b pb-2">3. Open-Source License</h2>
        <p>
          The Platform's source code is released under the MIT license. When
          citing database content, please credit "CCUS Policy Hub" as the
          source.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 text-sm text-slate-500 italic">
        Last updated: February 5, 2026
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
